 home features 3 bedroom & 2.5 baths. A spacious front flex room leads into a bright, open-concept main floor. The kitchen features full-height cabinetry, large quartz island & upgraded stainless steel appliances. Upstairs master bed boasts double vanity ensuite w/ walk-in shower along w/ sizeable walk-in closet. Additional 4pc bath & convenient upper-floor laundry located between bedrooms complete the level. The unfinished basement offers endless potential to create a space tailored to your needs. Outside, enjoy a partially fenced backyard & concrete parking pad w/ room for a future double garage. Close to schools, parks, trails, shopping, and amenities, this home offers the perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and affordability. Some photos have been virtually staged. Don’t miss this opportunity!! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$374,900"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,587 sq ft"],["Lot size","2,930 sq ft"],["Year built","2019"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Black Stone"],["Town","Leduc"],["Postal code","T9E1J6"],["MLS® number","E4515827"],["Listed","November 7, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Window Coverings"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Cooling","Central air conditioning"],["Basement","Unfinished, Full"],["Parking","Parking Pad"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","4.48m"],["Dining room","Main level","3.07m"],["Kitchen","Main level","3.07m"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","4.14m"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","2.93m"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","2.72m"],["Bonus Room","Main level","1.98m"]],"courtesy":"Ryley Trenchuk, MaxWell Devonshire Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"leduc","hood_slug":"black-stone","area":""}